  "source": "icanspeak Spanish original text (grammar-a1 run, 2026-11-04)",
  "subtitle": "In Spanish, the thing you like is the subject: me gusta el café (coffee pleases me). One thing or an action: me gusta. More than one thing: me gustan.",
  "briefMarks": ["me gusta", "me gustan", "a mí también", "a mí tampoco"],
  "concept": {
